{"id":3909,"date":"2025-07-31T23:34:49","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T23:34:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/fundedhero.com\/?page_id=3909"},"modified":"2025-08-21T16:12:47","modified_gmt":"2025-08-21T16:12:47","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/fundedherofutures.com\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your privacy is important to us. It is Funded Hero&#8217;s policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect from you across our website,&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/fundedherofutures.com\/\">Funded Hero<\/a>, and other sites we own and operate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We only ask for personal information when we truly need it to provide a service to you. We collect it by fair and lawful means, with your knowledge and consent. We also let you know why we\u2019re collecting it and how it will be used.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We only retain collected information for as long as necessary to provide you with your requested service. What data we store, we\u2019ll protect within commercially acceptable means to prevent loss and theft, as well as unauthorised access, disclosure, copying, use or modification.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We don\u2019t share any personally identifying information publicly or with third-parties, except when required to by law.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our website may link to external sites that are not operated by us. Please be aware that we have no control over the content and practices of these sites, and cannot accept responsibility or liability for their respective&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/privacypolicies.in\/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">privacy policies<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You are free to refuse our request for your personal information, with the understanding that we may be unable to provide you with some of your desired services.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your continued use of our website will be regarded as acceptance of our practices around privacy and personal information. If you have any questions about how we handle user data and personal information, feel free to contact us.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\/>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-cookie-policy-for-funded-hero\">Cookie Policy for Funded Hero<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is the Cookie Policy for Funded Hero, accessible from URL https:\/\/fundedherofutures.com\/.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-what-are-cookies\">What Are Cookies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As is common practice with almost all professional websites this site uses cookies, which are tiny files that are downloaded to your computer, to improve your experience. This page describes what information they gather, how we use it and why we sometimes need to store these cookies. We will also share how you can prevent these cookies from being stored however this may downgrade or break certain elements of the sites functionality.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-we-use-cookies\">How We Use Cookies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We use cookies for a variety of reasons detailed below. Unfortunately in most cases there are no industry standard options for disabling cookies without completely disabling the functionality and features they add to this site. It is recommended that you leave on all cookies if you are not sure whether you need them or not in case they are used to provide a service that you use.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-disabling-cookies\">Disabling Cookies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can prevent the setting of cookies by adjusting the settings on your browser (see your browser Help for how to do this). Be aware that disabling cookies will affect the functionality of this and many other websites that you visit. Disabling cookies will usually result in also disabling certain functionality and features of this site. Therefore it is recommended that you do not disable cookies.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-cookies-we-set\">The Cookies We Set<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-third-party-cookies\">Third Party Cookies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In some special cases we also use cookies provided by trusted third parties. The following section details which third party cookies you might encounter through this site.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-user-s-responsibilities\">User&#8217;s responsibilities<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The user undertakes the responsibility to make appropriate use of the contents and information offered on the site with enunciative, but not imitative, behaviour:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>A) Not to engage in activities that are illegal or contrary to good faith and public order;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>B) Not to spread propaganda or content of a racist, xenophobic or gambling nature, any type of illegal pornography, terrorist claims or against human rights;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>C) Do not cause damage to physical systems (hardware) and unattainable (software) of Funded Hero, its suppliers or third parties, to introduce or disseminate computer viruses or any other hardware or software systems that are capable of causing damage previously mentioned.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-more-information\">More information<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hopefully that has clarified things for you and as was previously mentioned if there is something that you aren&#8217;t sure whether you need or not it&#8217;s usually safer to leave cookies enabled in case it does interact with one of the features you use on our site.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\/>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-refund-policy\">Refund Policy<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At FundedHero, we value transparency and fairness in all our dealings. By purchasing a trading challenge with us, you acknowledge and accept the inherent risks involved in trading financial markets. Trading carries a high level of risk and may not be suitable for all individuals. You should carefully consider your financial situation, level of experience, and risk tolerance before participating.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-important-notice-regarding-refunds\">Important Notice Regarding Refunds:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No Refunds After Challenge Start \u2013 Once your challenge has begun (defined as your first login, trade placement, or access to the trading account), no refunds will be issued under any circumstances.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This policy applies regardless of trading results, strategy changes, or personal circumstances.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The fee paid for the challenge is strictly for the evaluation process and associated services. It does not represent a deposit, trading capital, or investment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-before-purchasing\">Before Purchasing:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please ensure you fully understand the rules, objectives, and terms of the challenge.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Make sure you are prepared to commit to the process before starting, as fees are non-refundable once the challenge has been initiated.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By completing your purchase, you agree to this refund policy and acknowledge the risks involved in trading.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-element-137cf8f7\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\